Package: GMP
Type: Package
Title: Publication-Ready Chromosome and Genomic Feature Maps
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Fei", "Liang", email = "fyliangfei@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Creates publication-ready chromosome maps and annotates genes or other genomic features from chromosome lengths and genomic coordinates. The package provides validated input handling, reusable plot objects, automatic label placement, and vector or raster export for reproducible genomic visualization workflows.
